
# Code of Conduct

## Our Pledge
We pledge to make participation in this project a welcoming experience for everyone.

## Our Standards
- Be respectful and considerate.
- Accept constructive feedback.
- Focus on what is best for the community.

## Enforcement Responsibilities
Project maintainers are responsible for clarifying and enforcing these standards.

## Scope
This code applies to all project spaces and community interactions.

## Enforcement
Unacceptable behavior may be reviewed by the project maintainers.

## Enforcement Guidelines
Maintainers will take appropriate and fair action based on the situation.

## Attribution
This Code of Conduct is inspired by community codes of conduct.
